    <abstract>
        <para>All records of vertebrates (apart from birds, which we do not store routinely, and Badger) available to HBRG including all those previously held on the database at IMAG. Assembly and mobilisation of this dataset has been funded by grants from Scottish Natural Heritage (now NatureScot) since 2004, and in some years by members of the Highland Biodiversity Partnership. For bird records, consult RSPB/BTO/SOC.</para>
    </abstract>
